                <circle cx="15" cy="75" r="5" fill="var(--teal)"/>\
            </svg>\
        </div>\
    </section>\
\
    <section class="pillar-grid">\
        <div class="pillar-content">\
            <h2>2. Buying and Selection</h2>\
            <p>Procurement must address the "perception gap," where executives report higher personal gains than their peers observe. Prioritise coaches with verified professional qualifications and deep behavioural expertise. Structured, psychologically informed frameworks are essential for ensuring skills transfer successfully back to the workplace.</p>\
        </div>\
        <div class="infographic-container">\
            <svg width="140" height="140" viewBox="0 0 100 100">\
                <rect x="20" y="20" width="25" height="25" rx="2" fill="var(--navy)" opacity="0.3"/>\
