                <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="40" fill="none" stroke="var(--navy)" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.2"/>\
                <path d="M50 5 L50 20 M50 80 L50 95 M5 50 L20 50 M80 50 L95 50" stroke="var(--navy)" stroke-width="2"/>\
            </svg>\
        </div>\
    </section>\
\
    <section class="pillar-grid">\
        <div class="pillar-content">\
            <h2>5. Managing for Lasting Impact</h2>\
            <p>To ensure change is permanent, maintain a Four-Way Agreement involving the coach, executive, HR, and CEO. Programmes must include a dedicated phase for embedding new habits. Growth requires moving from intensive intervention to a maintenance phase where new leadership behaviours are practiced consistently and become routine.</p>\
        </div>\
